Package: arma
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Portable Machine Image builder for pichi-vm
 Arma builds a Portable Machine Image from a kernel, optional initrd and
 command line. The tatu bare-metal boot stub is compiled with arma and
 embedded in the host binary installed at /usr/bin/arma.
